    "purpose": "Frozen transcription of the spec's token set. `tokens` is the required set of CSS custom properties; scripts/check-tokens.mjs asserts every one is present with this exact value (normalized only for case, whitespace, quote style and colour syntax) in the built CSS. `facts` records spec values that are not CSS custom properties and are asserted by the Playwright/unit checks.",
    "naming": "Where the spec names a custom property (colours), the spec name is used verbatim. Where the spec describes a role without a name (font stacks, type scale, motion timings, sizing, icons), the token name is the role name; values are transcribed verbatim."
